ex:DoD3 a backlog:DoDCriterion ; rdfs:label "Ticket spending follows the script rules"@en ; backlog:hasCheckQuery "On regtest, test joint signatures, holder-only spending after the time lock and rejection before it." .
ex:DoD4 a backlog:DoDCriterion ; rdfs:label "No personal data appears on chain"@en ; backlog:hasCheckQuery "Decode all test outputs and witnesses." .
